{
    "title": "Bible Study - Verse & Audio",
    "description": "Bible Study offers you curated scriptures, devotional guides, all at your fingertips.\r\n\r\n\r\nBible Study provides a free, simple, and user-friendly way to read the entire Bible without an internet connection. Focusing on helping Christians read and study scriptures daily, the Bible is at your reach wherever you are. You can use this Bible app daily to inspire your thoughts, with instant access to any chapter, the ability to add custom bookmarks, and more, providing a better Bible reading experience.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u3010Multi-language Versions\u3011\r\nIncluding multiple versions of the Old and New Testaments, with rich content and more Bibles to be added in the future. Comprehensive versions, easy and convenient to use.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u3010Beautiful Design\u3011\r\nWe provide a simple and clear layout, allowing you to read the Bible on your phone just like a printed version.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u3010Daily Verses\u3011\r\nDaily readings and check-ins, sharing daily golden Bible verses.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u3010Offline Reading\u3011\r\nProvides offline functionality, allowing you to read the Bible even without an active internet connection, helping users save on data.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u3010Customized Marking\u3011\r\nOffers a convenient and quick way to color-mark your favorite passages.\r\n\r\nJoin us in Bible Study, and immerse yourself in the wisdom and teachings of the Scriptures, accessible at all times. Enjoy a rich, fulfilling, and interactive Bible learning experience, tailored to fit your lifestyle. Explore, learn, and strengthen your faith through Bible exploration.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bible Study offers you curated scriptures, devotional guides, all at your fingertips.<br><br><br>Bible Study provides a free, simple, and user-friendly way to read the entire Bible without an internet connection. Focusing on helping Christians read and study scriptures daily, the Bible is at your reach wherever you are. You can use this Bible app daily to inspire your thoughts, with instant access to any chapter, the ability to add custom bookmarks, and more, providing a better Bible reading experience.<br><br>\u2728\u3010Multi-language Versions\u3011<br>Including multiple versions of the Old and New Testaments, with rich content and more Bibles to be added in the future. Comprehensive versions, easy and convenient to use.<br><br>\u2728\u3010Beautiful Design\u3011<br>We provide a simple and clear layout, allowing you to read the Bible on your phone just like a printed version.<br><br>\u2728\u3010Daily Verses\u3011<br>Daily readings and check-ins, sharing daily golden Bible verses.<br><br>\u2728\u3010Offline Reading\u3011<br>Provides offline functionality, allowing you to read the Bible even without an active internet connection, helping users save on data.<br><br>\u2728\u3010Customized Marking\u3011<br>Offers a convenient and quick way to color-mark your favorite passages.<br><br>Join us in Bible Study, and immerse yourself in the wisdom and teachings of the Scriptures, accessible at all times. Enjoy a rich, fulfilling, and interactive Bible learning experience, tailored to fit your lifestyle. Explore, learn, and strengthen your faith through Bible exploration.",
